      "caption_changes": [
        {
          "base": "Reported fit objective groups. The eight groups are disjoint and contain 307 quantities; common subset contains pressure, species and heat. Cai contains 25 temperatures and 25 vapor fractions at 25 states. Difference residuals are $(y_c-y_o)/s$; log ratio residuals are $\\ln(y_c/y_o)/s$. Cost is $\\frac12\\sum w r^2$. Scales are not uniformly measurement uncertainties.",
          "new": "Reported fit objective groups. The eight groups are disjoint and contain 307 quantities; common subset contains pressure, species and heat. Cai contains 25 temperatures and 25 vapor fractions at 25 states. Difference residuals are $(y_c-y_o)/s$; log ratio residuals are $\\ln(y_c/y_o)/s$. Cost is $\\frac12\\sum w r^2$. Scales are not uniformly measurement uncertainties. Where a highest scale is listed, the scale varies per observation between the two values."
