        {
          "base": "Sixteen fitted parameters and conditional standard errors (SE). Errors depend on weights, fixed inputs, bounds and local linearization. Born and segment diameters are separate; packing diameter is $0.88\\sigma$ and Debye--H\\\"uckel diameter is $\\sigma$. The R5 reciprocal-temperature coefficient precedes its enthalpy shift; R2/R5 shifts are total adjustments. Full optimizer transformations are in the data deposit.",
          "new": "Sixteen fitted parameters and conditional standard errors (SE). Errors depend on weights, fixed inputs, bounds and local linearization. Born and segment diameters are separate; packing diameter is $0.88\\sigma$ and Debye--H\\\"uckel diameter is $\\sigma$. The R5 reciprocal-temperature coefficient precedes its enthalpy shift; R2/R5 shifts are total adjustments. Full optimizer transformations are in the data deposit. A dash marks a parameter at a bound, for which no conditional SE is reported."
